#: src/dialog.c:93
msgid "Inspired by Windows 7"
msgstr "灵感来自 Windows 7"

#: src/dialog.c:94
msgid "Inspired by Windows 10"
msgstr "灵感来自 Windows 10"

#: src/dialog.c:95
msgid "Inspired by Windows 11"
msgstr "灵感来自 Windows 11"

#: src/dialog.c:96
msgid "Like the original Xfce button"
msgstr "与 Xfce 原版按钮相同"

#: src/dialog.c:98
msgid "Your own settings"
msgstr "自定义设置"

#: src/dialog.c:255
msgid "Detected: light panel"
msgstr "检测结果：浅色面板"

#: src/dialog.c:255
msgid "Detected: dark panel"
msgstr "检测结果：深色面板"

#: src/dialog.c:402
msgid "Select an icon"
msgstr "选择图标"

#: src/dialog.c:403
msgid "_Cancel"
msgstr "取消(_C)"

#: src/dialog.c:404
msgid "_OK"
msgstr "确定(_O)"

#. TRANSLATORS: entry in "Copy settings from another button";
#. * the first number is the panel, the second the plugin id
#: src/dialog.c:523
#, c-format
msgid "Panel %d — button #%d"
msgstr "面板 %d — 按钮 #%d"

#: src/dialog.c:583 src/plugin.c:1084
#: src/xfce-desktop-button-plugin.desktop.in:4
msgid "Desktop Button"
msgstr "桌面按钮"

#: src/dialog.c:585
msgid "_Close"
msgstr "关闭(_C)"

#: src/dialog.c:601
msgid "Button"
msgstr "按钮"

#. TRANSLATORS: profile names. "Glass", "Strip" and "Minimal" are styles
#. * inspired by Windows 7, 10 and 11; translate them as short style names
#: src/dialog.c:608 src/plugin.c:1030
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "自定义"

#: src/dialog.c:608 src/plugin.c:1030
msgid "Glass"
msgstr "玻璃"

#: src/dialog.c:608 src/plugin.c:1030
msgid "Strip"
msgstr "条带"

#: src/dialog.c:608 src/plugin.c:1030
msgid "Minimal"
msgstr "极简"

#: src/dialog.c:609 src/plugin.c:1030
msgid "Classic icon"
msgstr "经典图标"

#: src/dialog.c:610
msgid "_Profile:"
msgstr "配置方案(_P)："

#: src/dialog.c:617
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "自动"

#: src/dialog.c:617
msgid "Dark"
msgstr "深色"

#: src/dialog.c:617
msgid "Light"
msgstr "浅色"

#: src/dialog.c:619
msgid "Built-in profiles use white on dark panels and black on light panels"
msgstr "内置方案在深色面板上使用白色，在浅色面板上使用黑色"

#: src/dialog.c:620
msgid "Panel t_one:"
msgstr "面板色调(_O)："

#: src/dialog.c:629
msgid ""
"Width of the button along the panel. With the icon style it is the minimum "
"width: the button grows to fit the icon. In the middle of the panel, the "
"line styles use twice this width."
msgstr ""
"按钮沿面板方向的宽度。在图标样式中这是最小宽度：按钮会变宽以容纳图标。在面板"
"中间，线条样式使用此宽度的两倍。"

#: src/dialog.c:632
msgid "Button _thickness (px):"
msgstr "按钮粗细(_T)（像素）："

#: src/dialog.c:634 src/dialog.c:694 src/dialog.c:739
msgid "Line"
msgstr "线条"

#: src/dialog.c:634 src/dialog.c:670
msgid "Icon"
msgstr "图标"

#: src/dialog.c:634
msgid "None (background only)"
msgstr "无（仅背景）"

#: src/dialog.c:635
msgid "_Style:"
msgstr "样式(_S)："

#: src/dialog.c:637
msgid "Use a single panel _row"
msgstr "仅使用面板的一行(_R)"

#: src/dialog.c:639
msgid ""
"On panels with more than one row, the button takes up only one row instead "
"of the full height of the panel"
msgstr "在多行面板中，按钮只占一行，而不是占满面板的整个高度"

#: src/dialog.c:645
msgid ""
"Empty space between the button and the other items when the button is at one "
"end of the panel. It does not react to the mouse. In the middle of the panel "
"there is no gap: the button is twice as wide instead, with the line in the "
"center. With the glass shine, the button looks the same everywhere."
msgstr ""
"当按钮位于面板一端时，按钮与其他项目之间的空白。它不响应鼠标。在面板中间没有"
"空白，而是按钮宽度加倍，线条位于中央。启用玻璃光泽时，按钮在任何位置外观都相"
"同。"

#: src/dialog.c:650
msgid "Gap at the panel _ends (px):"
msgstr "面板两端的间距（像素）(_E)："

#: src/dialog.c:651
msgid "General"
msgstr "常规"

#: src/dialog.c:660
msgid "_Icon:"
msgstr "图标(_I)："

#: src/dialog.c:664
msgid ""
"The button grows to fit the icon. The only limit is the height of the panel."
msgstr "按钮会变宽以容纳图标。唯一的限制是面板的高度。"

#: src/dialog.c:665
msgid "Icon si_ze (px):"
msgstr "图标大小(_Z)（像素）："

#: src/dialog.c:667
msgid "_Follow the panel icon size"
msgstr "跟随面板图标大小(_F)"

#: src/dialog.c:680
msgid "Cop_y"
msgstr "复制(_Y)"

#: src/dialog.c:682
msgid "Replace all settings of this button with those of the selected one"
msgstr "用所选按钮的设置替换此按钮的全部设置"

#: src/dialog.c:686
msgid "Fro_m:"
msgstr "来源(_M)："

#: src/dialog.c:690
msgid "Copy settings from another button"
msgstr "从其他按钮复制设置"

#: src/dialog.c:700
msgid "Line _width (px):"
msgstr "线条粗细(_W)（像素）："

#. TRANSLATORS: unit of the line length: percent of the panel height, or pixels
#: src/dialog.c:707
#, no-c-format
msgid "% of panel"
msgstr "面板的 %"

#: src/dialog.c:707
msgid "px"
msgstr "像素"

#: src/dialog.c:711
msgid "Line _length:"
msgstr "线条长度(_L)："

#: src/dialog.c:717
msgid "Start (left / top)"
msgstr "起始（左 / 上）"

#: src/dialog.c:717
msgid "Center"
msgstr "居中"

#: src/dialog.c:717
msgid "End (right / bottom)"
msgstr "末端（右 / 下）"

#: src/dialog.c:718
msgid "Automatic (depends on where the button is)"
msgstr "自动（取决于按钮的位置）"

#: src/dialog.c:720
msgid ""
"Automatic: at one end of the panel, the line faces the other items; in the "
"middle, it goes in the center."
msgstr "自动：在面板一端时，线条朝向其他项目；在中间时，线条居中。"

#: src/dialog.c:722
msgid "_Position:"
msgstr "位置(_P)："

#: src/dialog.c:724
msgid "Always"
msgstr "始终"

#: src/dialog.c:724
msgid "Only on hover"
msgstr "仅在悬停时"

#: src/dialog.c:725
msgid "_Visible:"
msgstr "显示(_V)："

#: src/dialog.c:728
msgid "C_olor:"
msgstr "颜色(_O)："

#: src/dialog.c:731
msgid "Color on _hover:"
msgstr "悬停时颜色(_H)："

#: src/dialog.c:734
msgid "Color when p_ressed:"
msgstr "按下时颜色(_R)："

#: src/dialog.c:736
msgid "Rounded _ends"
msgstr "圆角端点(_E)"

#: src/dialog.c:743
msgid "Background"
msgstr "背景"

#: src/dialog.c:749
msgid "_Normal:"
msgstr "正常(_N)："

#: src/dialog.c:752
msgid "On h_over:"
msgstr "悬停时(_O)："

#: src/dialog.c:755
msgid "_Pressed:"
msgstr "按下时(_P)："

#: src/dialog.c:758
msgid "Corner _radius (px):"
msgstr "圆角半径(_R)（像素）："

#: src/dialog.c:764
msgid "Small"
msgstr "小"

#: src/dialog.c:765
msgid "Full"
msgstr "完整"

#: src/dialog.c:768
msgid "How much of the button the colored background covers"
msgstr "彩色背景覆盖按钮的比例"

#: src/dialog.c:769
msgid "_Size:"
msgstr "大小(_S)："

#: src/dialog.c:771
msgid "_Glass shine"
msgstr "玻璃光泽(_G)"

#: src/dialog.c:775
msgid "_Keep the pressed color while the desktop is shown"
msgstr "显示桌面时保持按下颜色(_K)"

#: src/dialog.c:778
msgid "Background colors"
msgstr "背景颜色"

#: src/dialog.c:783
msgid "Smooth _transitions"
msgstr "平滑过渡(_T)"

#: src/dialog.c:785
msgid ""
"Fade colors when hovering and clicking instead of changing them instantly"
msgstr "悬停和点击时渐变颜色，而不是立即切换"

#: src/dialog.c:788
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "快"

#: src/dialog.c:788
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "正常"

#: src/dialog.c:788
msgid "Slow"
msgstr "慢"

#: src/dialog.c:789
msgid "Spee_d:"
msgstr "速度(_D)："

#: src/dialog.c:791
msgid "Animations are disabled in the system settings."
msgstr "系统设置中已禁用动画。"

#: src/dialog.c:798
msgid "Animation"
msgstr "动画"

#: src/dialog.c:801
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "行为"

#: src/dialog.c:805 src/dialog.c:817
msgid "Do nothing"
msgstr "不执行任何操作"

#: src/dialog.c:805
msgid "Show / restore desktop"
msgstr "显示 / 恢复桌面"

#: src/dialog.c:806
msgid "Minimize all windows"
msgstr "最小化所有窗口"

#: src/dialog.c:807
msgid "Shade / unshade windows (X11 only)"
msgstr "卷起 / 展开窗口（仅 X11）"

#: src/dialog.c:808
msgid "_Middle click:"
msgstr "中键单击(_M)："

#: src/dialog.c:810
msgid "Window shading is not supported on Wayland."
msgstr "Wayland 不支持卷起窗口。"

#: src/dialog.c:817
msgid "Switch workspace"
msgstr "切换工作区"

#: src/dialog.c:818
msgid "Up shows desktop, down restores"
msgstr "向上显示桌面，向下恢复"

#: src/dialog.c:819
msgid "Mouse _wheel:"
msgstr "鼠标滚轮(_W)："

#: src/dialog.c:821
msgid "Workspace switching is not available in this session."
msgstr "此会话中无法切换工作区。"

#: src/dialog.c:828
msgid "Show desktop when _dragging a file over the button"
msgstr "将文件拖到按钮上时显示桌面(_D)"

#: src/dialog.c:832
msgid "Cop_y files dropped on the button to the Desktop"
msgstr "将拖放到按钮上的文件复制到桌面(_Y)"

#: src/dialog.c:834
msgid ""
"The original files are never moved or deleted, and existing files on the "
"Desktop are never overwritten: a copy gets a new name such as \"photo (2)."
"jpg\"."
msgstr ""
"原始文件绝不会被移动或删除，桌面上已有的文件也绝不会被覆盖：副本会得到新名"
"称，例如“photo (2).jpg”。"

#: src/dialog.c:838
msgid "Show _tooltip"
msgstr "显示工具提示(_T)"

#: src/dialog.c:841
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "操作"

#: src/dialog.c:848
msgid "Show the desktop while the mouse is _over the button"
msgstr "鼠标位于按钮上时显示桌面(_O)"

#: src/dialog.c:850
msgid ""
"Moving the mouse away restores the windows. Click during the peek to keep "
"the desktop visible."
msgstr "移开鼠标即可恢复窗口。在预览期间单击可使桌面保持可见。"

#: src/dialog.c:855
msgid "D_elay (ms):"
msgstr "延迟(_E)（毫秒）："

#: src/dialog.c:857
msgid "Peek"
msgstr "预览"

#: src/dialog.c:862
msgid ""
"Tip: place the button at one end of the panel and set the panel margin to 0 "
"so you can click it by pushing the mouse into the screen corner."
msgstr ""
"提示：将按钮放在面板任一端并把面板边距设为 0，即可将鼠标推到屏幕角落来点击"
"它。"

#: src/dialog.c:864
msgid "Keyboard shortcut command:"
msgstr "键盘快捷键命令："

#: src/plugin.c:302
msgid "Show desktop is not available in this session"
msgstr "此会话中无法显示桌面"

#: src/plugin.c:304
msgid "Restore the minimized windows"
msgstr "恢复已最小化的窗口"

#: src/plugin.c:306
msgid "Minimize all open windows and show the desktop"
msgstr "最小化所有打开的窗口并显示桌面"

#: src/plugin.c:312
msgid "Show Desktop"
msgstr "显示桌面"

#: src/plugin.c:1035
msgid "_Minimize all windows"
msgstr "最小化所有窗口(_M)"

#: src/plugin.c:1041
msgid "S_hade / unshade windows"
msgstr "卷起 / 展开窗口(_H)"

#: src/plugin.c:1057
msgid "_Profile"
msgstr "配置方案(_P)"

#: src/plugin.c:1086
msgid "A slim, customizable Show Desktop button"
msgstr "纤细且可自定义的“显示桌面”按钮"

#: src/xfce-desktop-button-plugin.desktop.in:5
msgid "Slim, customizable Show Desktop button"
msgstr "纤细且可自定义的“显示桌面”按钮"
